PMR is a Rust port of the PM2 process-manager workflow. Its command vocabulary,
configuration model, defaults and compatibility templates draw on PM2.

PM2: https://github.com/Unitech/pm2
Copyright holders include Alexandre Strzelewicz and the PM2 contributors.
Upstream licence: GNU Affero General Public License version 3.
Upstream licence text: https://github.com/Unitech/pm2/blob/master/GNU-AGPL-3.0.txt

Changes in PMR include a Rust supervisor and client, Unix socket communication,
Rust terminal monitoring, packaging, examples, tests and benchmark tooling.
PMR is independently maintained; PM2 and Keymetrics do not endorse this project.

